# Unzipped xlsx scratch from a design exercise (not source)
docs/design/_unzip_tmp/

# Signing keys. The updater's private key must never enter the repository —
# it is what proves an update came from this project, and a copy in git is a
# copy in every clone. Kept as a pattern rather than one path so a key written
# to the repo root by mistake is caught too.
*.key
*.pem
.tauri/
tauri-signing-*
